WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.900
I — have worn too many names.

2
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.520
Tried to find the one that fits.

3
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.320
Identified myself by what I've done.

4
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.080
Cared what the world thinks.

5
00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.820
Afraid to come up empty.

6
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:35.480
Afraid to leave no mark.

7
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.800
Traded everything I was.

8
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.780
Trying to find out who I am.

9
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.840
But in the garden in the dark.

10
00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.440
He — didn't come to teach or speak.

11
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.720
Christ — measured the full weight of me.

12
00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:59.240
Every sorrow, every dream.

13
00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.260
Every shame I've carried quietly.

14
00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.420
Every hope I couldn't name.

15
00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.420
He felt it all from the inside.

16
00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.560
And — He didn't turn away.

17
00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.440
You always knew me.

18
00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.180
Before I knew myself.

19
00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.420
You didn't wait for me to find you.

20
00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:29.680
You came to know me first, earn my trust.

21
00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.760
I am a child of God.

22
00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.220
That's who I've always been.

23
00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:38.560
I don't have to search anymore.

24
00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:44.440
I'm already known.

25
00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:48.080
I'm already loved.

26
00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:54.980
I've found my heavenly home.

27
00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:12.620
He — didn't stay dead, He lives

28
00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:16.220
That's the thing that makes it real.

29
00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.400
He — rose and works among the faithful still.

30
00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.540
Not a memory.

31
00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.360
Not just an ideal.

32
00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:30.040
All that time I spent on fear.

33
00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.860
All that searching, all that weight.

34
00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:40.840
Now I set it free — and I'll use it well.

35
00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.780
On something worth my days.

36
00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.200
Not just a teacher.

37
00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.660
Not just a death.

38
00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:58.140
He used the power of Creation.

39
00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:01.660
To know me first.

40
00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.940
And knowing me completely.

41
00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:08.640
He thought I was worth His life.

42
00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:11.740
He thought you were worth it, too.

43
00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:15.740
He still does.

44
00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:19.340
You always knew me.

45
00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.960
Before I knew myself.

46
00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:26.200
You didn't wait for me to find you.

47
00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:31.540
You came to know me first, earn my trust.

48
00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:36.100
I am a child of God, and so are you.

49
00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:40.420
You don't have to search anymore.

50
00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.300
You're already known.

51
00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:50.260
You're already loved.

52
00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:56.080
Welcome home...

53
00:03:56.080 --> 00:04:06.100
The search is over it was always over.

54
00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:11.360
He just wanted you to know.

55
00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:16.680
In the name of Jesus Christ.

56
00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:19.340
Amen.
